e man.\",\"relative_size\":\"medium within frame\",\"shape_and_color\":\"Rectangular shape when laid flat, dark navy blue.\",\"texture\":\"Smooth, slightly textured cotton blend.\",\"appearance_details\":\"Single-button closure, notched lapels, two large patch pockets.\",\"orientation\":\"Worn on the man's upper body\"}],\"background_setting\":\"A plain, light grey wall with a white baseboard at the bottom, providing a minimalist studio-like backdrop.\",\"lighting\":{\"conditions\":\"Even, soft studio lighting\",\"direction\":\"Front-lit\",\"shadows\":\"Minimal, soft shadows directly behind the man, indicating diffused light.\"},\"aesthetics\":{\"composition\":\"Centered, full-body shot, portrait composition.\",\"color_scheme\":\"Monochromatic grey background with white, blue, and dark navy clothing, creating a clean and simple palette.\",\"mood_atmosphere\":\"Clean, modern, casual, and straightforward.\",\"aesthetic_score\":\"very high\",\"preference_score\":\"very high\"},\"photographic_characteristics\":{\"depth_of_field\":\"Shallow, with the man in sharp focus and the background slightly blurred.\",\"focus\":\"Sharp focus on subject.\",\"camera_angle\":\"Eye-level\",\"lens_focal_length\":\"standard lens (e.g., 35mm-50mm)\"},\"style_medium\":\"photograph\",\"context\":\"This is a concept for a fashion e-commerce product photograph, showcasing a casual outfit on a male model.\",\"artistic_style\":\"realistic\",\"edit_instruction\":\"Integrate the dark navy blazer from <image_2> onto the person in <image_1>, layering it over their existing white t-shirt and ensuring all visual properties of the blazer are reproduced exactly.\"}}"
